# Build context exclusions (#119, ADR-0017 D5). SDK container publishing does not read this file; it
# protects any `docker build .` from the repository root. Images are public, so nothing local or secret
# may ever enter a build context.
.git
.vs
.vscode
.claude
.agent-logs
ops.local
.devcontainer
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user
**/bin
**/obj
artifacts
**/node_modules
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
TestResults
